  "notes": "FORMS:\n{嘘|うそ} (lie) + つき (from {付|つ}く, to attach/stick) → one who lies\n- {大嘘|おおうそ}つき (big liar, pathological liar)\n- {嘘|うそ}つきは{泥棒|どろぼう}の{始|はじ}まり (A liar is the beginning of a thief - proverb)\n\nUSAGE:\nCan be used both as a direct insult and as a general description of someone's character.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {嘘|うそ} (lie, falsehood)\n- {嘘|うそ}をつく (to tell a lie)\n- {詐欺師|さぎし} (swindler, con artist)\n- {正直者|しょうじきもの} (honest person - antonym)",
